[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651670164","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120087#issuecomment-4651670164","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120087","id":4651670164,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFULalA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T17:33:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T12:30:36Z","body":"~I have a Windows 11 device and use network storage so I can see about testing this perhaps tomorrow if I can fit it in, but I'd need some references for how to test it properly~\r\n\r\nWon't be able to test this for the forseeable future as my dev setup isn't configured currently on windows","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651670164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651897185","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120087#issuecomment-4651897185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120087","id":4651897185,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFUZRYQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T18:01:07Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T18:01:07Z","body":"You'll need a directory with a file in it on the network drive. Then create a symlink to the directory. The following `EditorScript` should suffice (replacing the paths accordingly):\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends EditorScript\r\n\r\nfunc _run():\r\n    var d := DirAccess.open(\"res://\")\r\n    assert(d.is_equivalent(\"Z:\\\\\", \"Z:\\\\\"))\r\n\r\n    assert(d.is_equivalent(\"Z:\\\\original_dir\\\\\", \"Z:\\\\original_dir\\\\\"))\r\n    assert(d.is_equivalent(\"Z:\\\\original_dir\\\\file.txt\", \"Z:\\\\original_dir\\\\file.txt\"))\r\n\r\n    assert(d.is_equivalent(\"Z:\\\\link\\\\\", \"Z:\\\\link\\\\\"))\r\n    assert(d.is_equivalent(\"Z:\\\\link\\\\file.txt\", \"Z:\\\\link\\\\file.txt\"))\r\n\r\n    assert(d.is_equivalent(\"Z:\\\\link\\\\\", \"Z:\\\\original_dir\\\\\"))\r\n    assert(d.is_equivalent(\"Z:\\\\link\\\\file.txt\", \"Z:\\\\original_dir\\\\file.txt\"))\r\n```\r\n\r\n(I'd assume the inverted cases to work correctly.)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651897185/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4657780960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120087#issuecomment-4657780960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120087","id":4657780960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFaAY4A","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T08:23:51Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T08:23:51Z","body":"> I was not able to reproduce the issue on Windows 11 (neither with USB drives nor with network shares)\r\n\r\nTo be sure, I also asked the original reporter of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111702 for confirmation. It seems to work for their effected device.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4657780960/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4745817867","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120087#issuecomment-4745817867","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120087","id":4745817867,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGt9vCw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T20:20:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T20:20:36Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4745817867/reactions","total_count":0,"